97
00:08:14,100 --> 00:08:17,900
Senior Mewto, that thing about the prince who lost his heart.

98
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,400
Oh, I haven't made him an apology for his leg yet.

99
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:23,380
