111
00:08:57,300 --> 00:08:59,800
Of course it is. He wouldn't read it if it wasn't.

112
00:08:59,860 --> 00:09:00,620
Not really.

113
00:09:00,900 --> 00:09:01,100
Huh?

114
00:09:01,100 --> 00:09:04,680
