135
00:09:49,500 --> 00:09:50,000
Ah!

136
00:09:50,220 --> 00:09:50,940
Excuse me.

137
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:56,840
Quack!

138
00:09:56,840 --> 00:10:04,640
