194
00:11:42,100 --> 00:11:46,140
As this adage aptly demonstrates, daily practice is of the utmost importance.

195
00:11:46,140 --> 00:11:50,500
And so, we will have a test once a month from now on to assign you to a class.

196
00:11:51,100 --> 00:11:54,540
In the worst case, you'll be dropped to the probationary class.

197
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:55,260
What?

198
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:56,080
