00:15:00,780 --> 00:15:01,780
Ah!

249
00:15:01,780 --> 00:15:02,780
Ah!

250
00:15:07,780 --> 00:15:08,780
Ah!

251
00:15:20,780 --> 00:15:21,780
Ah!

252
00:15:21,780 --> 00:15:22,780
Ah!

253
00:15:22,780 --> 00:15:23,780
Ah!

254
00:15:23,780 --> 00:15:24,780
Ah!

255
00:15:24,780 --> 00:15:47,440
You were wonderful.

256
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:50,760
Mimi, it's almost like she wasn't duck.

257
00:15:51,060 --> 00:15:51,780
You're right.

258
00:15:52,100 --> 00:15:53,660
I wasn't duck at all.

259
00:15:54,780 --> 00:16:03,640
